# cards: the Yeti card steals (docs/plan-cards.md 8, point 4). Lucia wears Yeti (223, her slot 0x020B46FE) at 1800
# points (0x020B4892); first temple battle, the enemies' HP pinned. Her card entry opens the enemy grid (shot ye_grid);
# A uses it on the highlighted monster. The random state is set to 24 (roll 3, under 25) at the steal's first roll
# (cave_skill_steal + 0x48). Expect: points 1800 -> 1700, the battle flags gain that monster's robbed bit, the stolen
# item in cave_skill_stolen (0x01FFB7C0 in this build), "Stole <item>!" on the message line (shots ye_msg_*).
# Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba0e 1
poke u16 0x020b4892 1800
poke u16 0x020b46fe 223
execpoke 0x01FFB8C4 u32 0x020A0238 24
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u32 0x02282940 flags
watch u16 0x01FFB7C0 stolen
watch u16 0x020b4892 points
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot ye_grid
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 3000
wait 25
shot ye_msg_0
wait 25
shot ye_msg_1
wait 25
shot ye_msg_2
wait 25
shot ye_msg_3
wait 25
shot ye_msg_4
wait 25
shot ye_msg_5
wait 25
shot ye_msg_6
wait 25
shot ye_msg_7
wait 25
shot ye_msg_8
wait 25
shot ye_msg_9
wait 25
shot ye_msg_10
wait 25
shot ye_msg_11
wait 25
shot ye_msg_12
wait 25
shot ye_msg_13
wait 25
shot ye_msg_14
wait 25
shot ye_msg_15
